* CCM mode\nNIST SP 800-38C
** Inputs
*** Payload P: encrypted + authenticated
*** Associated data A: authenticated only
*** Nonce N: unique per key
** Primitives
*** CTR mode (confidentiality)
*** CBC-MAC, zero IV (authenticity)
*** One AES key, forward cipher only
** Formatting function
*** B0 fixes nonce and payload length
*** Encoding of (N, A, P) is unique
*** B0 never equals a counter block
** Processes
*** Generation-encryption\nT = CBC-MAC, C = CTR(P) || CTR(T)
*** Decryption-verification\nreturns P or INVALID
*** No plaintext before verification
*** Errors indistinguishable
left side
** Appendix A encoding
*** n + q = 15
*** t in {4, 6, ..., 16} octets
*** Flags octet: Adata, t, q
*** 2 / 6 / 10 octet length of A
** MAC length (Appendix B)
*** Tlen >= lg(MaxErrs / Risk)
*** Below 64 bits only with analysis
** Security
*** Nonce reuse leaks P1 xor P2
*** No replay protection
*** 2^61 block cipher calls per key
*** Sequential, length known in advance
** Deployments
*** WPA2 CCMP
*** Bluetooth LE, 802.15.4 (CCM*)
*** TLS 1.3, IPsec
@endmindmap
